# Empty on purpose: axios then issues relative URLs (/api/..., /auth/...) which the
# Vite dev server proxies (see server.proxy in vite.config.ts). Keeping requests
# same-origin is what lets the SameSite=Lax session cookie work from localhost.
#
# Set a value here only to bypass the proxy entirely — note the api container
# publishes on 8001, not 8000 (API_HOST_PORT in docker-compose.yml).
#
# To point dev at the deployed backend, set VITE_PROXY_TARGET in .env.local.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
